
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.011253285 -0.0095616392 -0.044624891) to (41.036747 40.636546 42.200625)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
